<Slide style={{ background: "#0B1220", padding: "44px 72px", display: "flex", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 14, letterSpacing: 3 }}>工程实现</Text>
  <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, marginTop: 10 }}>三套能力收敛成一张工具注册表</Text>

  <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: 14, marginTop: 30 }}>
    <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "stretch" }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 190, background: "rgba(34,197,94,0.10)", border: "1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.45)", borderRadius: 10, padding: 20, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#22C55E", fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 700 }}>内置工具</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 6 }}>21 个</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: "1px solid #374151", borderRadius: 10, padding: 20 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 600 }}>策略表与参数契约是唯一事实来源</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>新增一个工具三步：在参数契约加槽位，在策略表加风险画像，在执行层加分支。描述符与模型工具集自动包含，界面的工具清单同步更新。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "stretch" }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 190, background: "rgba(59,130,246,0.10)", border: "1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.45)", borderRadius: 10, padding: 20, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#93C5FD", fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 700 }}>外部服务</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 6 }}>4 服务 13 工具</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: "1px solid #374151", borderRadius: 10, padding: 20 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 600 }}>走 MCP 协议，独立进程</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>汇率、反欺诈、理财费率、生日礼遇四个服务各自独立进程，超时与失败隔离，某个服务挂掉不影响内置工具。外部工具名统一加前缀，既是路由依据也是防伪依据。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "stretch" }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 190, background: "rgba(245,158,11,0.10)", border: "1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.45)", borderRadius: 10, padding: 20, display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F59E0B", fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 700 }}>技能库</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 15, marginTop: 6 }}>按需加载</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: "1px solid #374151", borderRadius: 10, padding: 20 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: "#F7F4EC", fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 600 }}>两段式渐进披露</Text>
        <Text style={{ color: "#9CA3AF", fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>系统提示词只放目录摘要，每条截断到八十字符。模型判断需要哪一项，再调用加载工具取全文，上限四千字符。提示词体积从一千九百七十一字符降到一百八十四字符。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Text style={{ color: "#6B7280", fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 24 }}>注册表三条约束：同名工具直接报错不覆盖，外部工具失败不影响内置，可按来源或按服务器整体移除。</Text>
</Slide>
